# iCloud conflict copies. This repo lives under ~/Documents, which is synced by
# iCloud Drive (Desktop & Documents). A burst of file writes — `goat export-web`
# writes 500 JSON files into public/goat/players — makes the file provider drop
# numbered copies ("abdulka01 2.json") beside the originals. They are never real
# content and must never be committed.
* [0-9].*
* [0-9][0-9].*
